abstract: >-
  Unconditional proof of Proposition (1 - 1.67440) for the twin prime problem.
  The proof uses Ibarra's 1.2806 Chen lower bound, a positive upper sieve at
  distribution level 5/8, a delayed four-slot refinement, and directed integer
  certificates.
